{"itemKind": "mcq", "contentVersion": "imp-101", "knowledgePointRef": "grammar.imperative", "skillRef": "grammar", "payload": {"sentence": "___ the door, please.（開けてください）", "choices": ["Open", "Opens", "Opening", "You open"], "answer": "Open", "explanation": "命令文は主語を書かず、動詞の原形で始めます。"}}
{"itemKind": "mcq", "contentVersion": "imp-102", "knowledgePointRef": "grammar.imperative", "skillRef": "grammar", "payload": {"sentence": "___ run in the hallway.（走ってはいけません）", "choices": ["Don't", "Doesn't", "Not", "No"], "answer": "Don't", "explanation": "禁止は Don't ＋ 動詞の原形です。主語がなくても Don't を使います。"}}
