{"itemKind": "mcq", "contentVersion": "imp-105", "knowledgePointRef": "grammar.imperative", "skillRef": "grammar", "payload": {"sentence": "___ quiet in the library.（静かにして）", "choices": ["Be", "Are", "Is", "Do"], "answer": "Be", "explanation": "be動詞の命令文は Be で始めます。Are ではありません。"}}
{"itemKind": "mcq", "contentVersion": "imp-106", "knowledgePointRef": "grammar.imperative", "skillRef": "grammar", "payload": {"sentence": "___ be late for school.（遅刻しないで）", "choices": ["Don't", "Not", "No", "Doesn't"], "answer": "Don't", "explanation": "be動詞の否定命令も Don't be の形になります。"}}
